      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Multi-ATS Tech Job Board & B2B Hiring Intent Signal Radar Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nExtracts live tech job openings from public Greenhouse ATS boards (Zero-Proxy, Zero-Key). Detects B2B buying intent signals, remote status, department expansion, and scores hiring velocity (0-100) for sales and recruiting teams.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/multi-ats-tech-job-board-hiring-radar](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/multi-ats-tech-job-board-hiring-radar)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: multi-ats-tech-job-board-hiring-radar** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1d531e2e-704b-5626-9016-766bb915aa94",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
